size 100 10
start
keys <Tab> j x <CR>
keys <Tab> <Tab> j x <CR>
frame a-frame
keys o
frame b-frame
cursor b-cursor
type Call
keys <CR>
frame c-frame
file todo.txt a-file
-- config.toml --
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
A +work @phone
B +home
C +work @phone
-- a-frame --
┌[3]─Projects─┐┌ [1]─+work  @phone ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home    1/1││  1   A                                                               +work @phone │
│>+work    2/2││  1   C                                                               +work @phone │
├[4]─Contexts─┤│                                                                                   │
│>@phone   2/2││                                                                                   │
├[5]─Filters──┤│                                                                                   │
│ [x] Done    ││                                                                                   │
│ [ ] Later   ││                                                                                   │
└─────────────┘└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  x done  t state  o new  a append  dd delete  u undo  / search  ? help
-- b-frame --
┌[3]─Projects─┐┌ [1]─+work  @phone ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home    1/1││  1   A                                                               +work @phone │
│>+work    2/2││     +work                                                                         │
├[4]─Contexts─┤│  1   C                                                               +work @phone │
│>@phone   2/2││                                                                                   │
├[5]─Filters──┤│                                                                                   │
│ [x] Done    ││                                                                                   │
│ [ ] Later   ││                                                                                   │
└─────────────┘└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 INSERT  todo.txt  manual  <CR> commit  <C-w> del word  <C-u> del to start
-- b-cursor --
│>+work    2/2││     +work                                                                         │
                    ^
-- c-frame --
┌[3]─Projects─┐┌ [1]─+work  @phone ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home    1/1││  1   A                                                     +work @phone           │
│>+work    3/3││  2   Call                                                  +work         filtered │
├[4]─Contexts─┤│  1   C                                                     +work @phone           │
│>@phone   2/2││                                                                                   │
├[5]─Filters──┤│                                                                                   │
│ [x] Done    ││                                                                                   │
│ [ ] Later   ││                                                                                   │
└─────────────┘└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  2 added: Call; hidden by current filters in 2 seconds or at the next key
-- a-file --
A +work @phone
2026-09-29 Call +work
B +home
C +work @phone
